# Optional: directory that contains the `finrl` package if it is not installed
# via pip. Inside this FinRL fork the parent checkout is used automatically.
# FINRL_ROOT=/path/to/FinRL

# Data lives under configs/datasets.yaml (what / how / where / format) and
# `dataset:` in configs/default.yaml. No WRDS credentials are used in this repo.
# Copy the AB_finRL extract to:
#   data/raw/ab_wrds/wrds_processed.csv
#   data/raw/ab_wrds/wrds_tickers.csv
